**Related:** `.slot:has(.capacity-badge) .course-block:first-of-type .cb-student` padding — **4938–4942**.

**`clip`:** not used on these selectors in this file.

**`max-height` near week UI:** `.week-teacher-chips-scroll` uses `max-height: 5.5rem; overflow-y: auto;` at **3590–3597** (teacher filter chips, not day cells).

